<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on June 19.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on June 19.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 June 19		June 18</p>
<p>Fed acct			 7.212		  9.0507</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  33.458		 31.407</p>
<p>Cash balance		  40.671		 40.458</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,243.943	     5,246.481</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $3 million were issued and $62 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
